===== P: pause order (paren post), SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE then SPINDLE_UNLOCK_PAUSE =====
[()-P off 'M0' 'M5' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'D' runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to stop the spindle and pause for the operator before it
