[;-P unlock 'M0' 'M5' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'A' starts the spindle after the spindle-off toolpath 'D', but the post's SPINDLE_UNLOCK_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to pause for the operator to unlock the spindle before it
[;-P off 'M1' 'M5' 'M0' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'D' runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to stop the spindle and pause for the operator before it
[;-P unlock 'M1' 'M5' 'M0' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'A' starts the spindle after the spindle-off toolpath 'D', but the post's SPINDLE_UNLOCK_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to pause for the operator to unlock the spindle before it
[;-P off 'M5' 'M0' ] ACCEPTED
[;-P unlock 'M5' 'M0' ] ACCEPTED
[;-P off '; M5' 'M0' 'M5' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'D' runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to stop the spindle and pause for the operator before it
[;-P unlock '; M5' 'M0' 'M5' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'A' starts the spindle after the spindle-off toolpath 'D', but the post's SPINDLE_UNLOCK_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to pause for the operator to unlock the spindle before it
[;-P off 'M0 ; then M5' 'M5' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'D' runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to stop the spindle and pause for the operator before it
[;-P unlock 'M0 ; then M5' 'M5' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'A' starts the spindle after the spindle-off toolpath 'D', but the post's SPINDLE_UNLOCK_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to pause for the operator to unlock the spindle before it
[;-P off 'M0' 'M5 ; x' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'D' runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to stop the spindle and pause for the operator before it
[;-P unlock 'M0' 'M5 ; x' ] REFUSED: cannot write G-code: toolpath 'A' starts the spindle after the spindle-off toolpath 'D', but the post's SPINDLE_UNLOCK_PAUSE block pauses (M0 or M1) before it stops the spindle (M5); write the M5 first to pause for the operator to unlock the spindle before it
[;-P off 'M5' 'M0 ; y' ] ACCEPTED
[;-P unlock 'M5' 'M0 ; y' ] ACCEPTED
===== P: values that write M words (template sees a tag as a space) =====
[()-P VAR T prefix M -> written M3? (tool 3)] REFUSED: cannot write G-code in SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE of toolpath 'D': the toolpath runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post writes the code M3 (not on the drag-section allowlist) (line 'M3')
[()-P VAR T prefix M -> written M1 (tool 1)] REFUSED: cannot write G-code in SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE of toolpath 'D': the toolpath runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block wrote M0 or M1 before M5; the spindle must be stopped before the pause
[()-P VAR T prefix M -> written M0 (tool 0)] REFUSED: cannot write G-code in SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE of toolpath 'D': the toolpath runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block wrote M0 or M1 before M5; the spindle must be stopped before the pause
[()-P N prefix ' M' (line number 1)] REFUSED: cannot write G-code in SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE of toolpath 'D': the toolpath runs with the spindle off (tool 'Drag' must not turn), but the post's SPINDLE_OFF_PAUSE block wrote M0 or M1 before M5; the spindle must be stopped before the pause
